  <!-- Arcane forge alternate recipe's -->
  <!--原中文: '制作象矛', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'elephant spear',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: elephant spear-->
  <ArcaneForge_ElephantSpear.label>制作象矛</ArcaneForge_ElephantSpear.label>
  <!--原中文: '象矛是用大象的獠牙制成的，通常是为猎人或部落首领保留的身份象征。轴上刻有微小的附魔，进一步提升了使用者的战斗能力。\n		\n这种武器被施以魔法，并为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的好处：\n提升最大能量值: +10%\n技能强度: +10%\n技能抗性: +20', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'The elephant spear is crafted using the tusks of an elephant, and is typically a status symbol reserved for head hunters or leaders of a tribe. The shaft is engraved with minor enchantments, further boosting the combat abilities of the user.
		
This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +10%
Damage Boost: +10%
Arcane Resistance: +20%',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: The elephant spear is crafted using the tusks of an elephant, and is typically a status symbol reserved for head hunters or leaders of a tribe. The shaft is engraved with minor enchantments, further boosting the combat abilities of the user.
		
This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +10%
Damage Boost: +10%
Arcane Resistance: +20%-->
  <ArcaneForge_ElephantSpear.description>象矛是用大象的獠牙制成的，通常是为猎人或部落首领保留的身份象征。轴上刻有微小的附魔，进一步提升了使用者的战斗能力。\n		\n这种武器被施以魔法，并为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的好处：\n提升最大能量值: +10%\n技能强度: +10%\n技能抗性: +20</ArcaneForge_ElephantSpear.description>
  <!--原中文: '制作象矛', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'forging Elephant Spear',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: forging Elephant Spear-->
  <ArcaneForge_ElephantSpear.jobString>制作象矛</ArcaneForge_ElephantSpear.jobString>
  <!--原中文: '制作撼地斧', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'thrumbo axe',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: thrumbo axe-->
  <ArcaneForge_ThrumboAxe.label>制作撼地斧</ArcaneForge_ThrumboAxe.label>
  <!--原中文: '一个由敲击兽角和魔法原石制成的握柄组合而成的斧子. 此握柄中存储着奥术能量并且会在撼地斧被挥舞时转化为物理力量, 其强大的力量甚至可以一击将数个敌人劈成两半. 此斧握柄上同样铭刻着神秘的符文来增强使用者的奥术能量。\n		\n这种武器被施以魔法，并为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的好处：\n提升最大能量值: +10%\n技能强度: +20%\n技能抗性: +30%\n劈裂冲击', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'An axe crafted using thrumbo horns that are fused together with a clasp made from magicyte. This clasp stores arcane potential and transfers it as physical force when the axe is swung, allowing it to deliver mighty blows capable of cleaving through multiple opponents. The shaft is also etched with magical runes to augment the wielder's power.
		
This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +10%
Damage Boost: +20%
Arcane Resistance: +30%',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: An axe crafted using thrumbo horns that are fused together with a clasp made from magicyte. This clasp stores arcane potential and transfers it as physical force when the axe is swung, allowing it to deliver mighty blows capable of cleaving through multiple opponents. The shaft is also etched with magical runes to augment the wielder's power.
		
This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +10%
Damage Boost: +20%
Arcane Resistance: +30%-->
  <ArcaneForge_ThrumboAxe.description>一个由敲击兽角和魔法原石制成的握柄组合而成的斧子. 此握柄中存储着奥术能量并且会在撼地斧被挥舞时转化为物理力量, 其强大的力量甚至可以一击将数个敌人劈成两半. 此斧握柄上同样铭刻着神秘的符文来增强使用者的奥术能量。\n		\n这种武器被施以魔法，并为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的好处：\n提升最大能量值: +10%\n技能强度: +20%\n技能抗性: +30%\n劈裂冲击</ArcaneForge_ThrumboAxe.description>
  <!--原中文: '制作撼地斧', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'forging Thrumbo Axe',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: forging Thrumbo Axe-->
  <ArcaneForge_ThrumboAxe.jobString>制作撼地斧</ArcaneForge_ThrumboAxe.jobString>
  <!--原中文: '制作秘能刀', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'thrumbo saber',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: thrumbo saber-->
  <ArcaneForge_ThrumboSaber.label>制作秘能刀</ArcaneForge_ThrumboSaber.label>
  <!--原中文: '一把锋利的刀锋被注入了一些神秘的能量。让它比金属刀轻，它的刃可以穿透所有的盔甲，但某些厚的要死的盔甲除外。许多刀锋高手都喜欢这种武器，因为它是为了速度和杀伤力而设计的。进一步的附魔也可以让使用者加速，在短时间内使他们的攻击率翻倍。   \n这件武器是附魔的，为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的收益：\n技能冷却时间: -10%\n伤害提升: +10%\n击中时急速 (25%)', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'A razor sharp blade forged from the horn of a thrumbo and infused with arcane energy. The thrumbo saber is lighter than metal blades and it's edge can cut through all but the thickest armor. Many masters of the blade favor this weapon as it is designed for speed and lethality. Further enchantments may also quicken the users, doubling their attack rate for a short period.
		
This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Ability Cooldown: -10%
Damage Boost: +10%
Haste on hit (25%)',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: A razor sharp blade forged from the horn of a thrumbo and infused with arcane energy. The thrumbo saber is lighter than metal blades and it's edge can cut through all but the thickest armor. Many masters of the blade favor this weapon as it is designed for speed and lethality. Further enchantments may also quicken the users, doubling their attack rate for a short period.
		
This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Ability Cooldown: -10%
Damage Boost: +10%
Haste on hit (25%)-->
  <ArcaneForge_ThrumboSaber.description>一把锋利的刀锋被注入了一些神秘的能量。让它比金属刀轻，它的刃可以穿透所有的盔甲，但某些厚的要死的盔甲除外。许多刀锋高手都喜欢这种武器，因为它是为了速度和杀伤力而设计的。进一步的附魔也可以让使用者加速，在短时间内使他们的攻击率翻倍。   \n这件武器是附魔的，为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的收益：\n技能冷却时间: -10%\n伤害提升: +10%\n击中时急速 (25%)</ArcaneForge_ThrumboSaber.description>
  <!--原中文: '正在制作秘能刀', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'forging Thrumbo Saber',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: forging Thrumbo Saber-->
  <ArcaneForge_ThrumboSaber.jobString>正在制作秘能刀</ArcaneForge_ThrumboSaber.jobString>
  <!--原中文: '制作象牙弓', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'elephant bow',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: elephant bow-->
  <ArcaneForge_ElephantBow.label>制作象牙弓</ArcaneForge_ElephantBow.label>
  <!--原中文: '象牙做成的弓。象牙是神圣的，为减少硬度和重量，通过浸泡在魔力伊特中软化。虽然操控难度稍大一些，象弓在射程和精度方面有了显著的提高。\n象弓上刻有微小的附魔，是许多经验丰富的游骑兵和猎人的首选武器。\n\n这种武器被施以魔法，并为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的好处：\n提升最大能量值: +5%\n提升能量回复速度: +5%\n技能强度: +10%\n技能冷却缩减: -10%', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'A bow shaped from elephant tusks. The tusks are hallowed out to decrease rigidity and reduce weight and softened by soaking it in a magicyte compound that increases suppleness. The elephant bow offers significant improvements in range and accuracy for distant targets over the greatbow, though it is slightly more difficult to handle.
	
The elephant bow is engraved with minor enchantments and is a preferred weapon by many experienced rangers and hunters.

This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +5%
Energy Regen: +5%
Damage Boost: +10%
Ability Cooldown: -10%',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: A bow shaped from elephant tusks. The tusks are hallowed out to decrease rigidity and reduce weight and softened by soaking it in a magicyte compound that increases suppleness. The elephant bow offers significant improvements in range and accuracy for distant targets over the greatbow, though it is slightly more difficult to handle.
	
The elephant bow is engraved with minor enchantments and is a preferred weapon by many experienced rangers and hunters.

This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +5%
Energy Regen: +5%
Damage Boost: +10%
Ability Cooldown: -10%-->
  <ArcaneForge_ElephantBow.description>象牙做成的弓。象牙是神圣的，为减少硬度和重量，通过浸泡在魔力伊特中软化。虽然操控难度稍大一些，象弓在射程和精度方面有了显著的提高。\n象弓上刻有微小的附魔，是许多经验丰富的游骑兵和猎人的首选武器。\n\n这种武器被施以魔法，并为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的好处：\n提升最大能量值: +5%\n提升能量回复速度: +5%\n技能强度: +10%\n技能冷却缩减: -10%</ArcaneForge_ElephantBow.description>
  <!--原中文: '制作象牙弓', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'forging elephant bow',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: forging elephant bow-->
  <ArcaneForge_ElephantBow.jobString>制作象牙弓</ArcaneForge_ElephantBow.jobString>
  <!--原中文: '制作鹰角弓', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Thrum Bow',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Thrum Bow-->
  <ArcaneForge_ThrumBow.label>制作鹰角弓</ArcaneForge_ThrumBow.label>
  <!--原中文: '由敲击兽的角制作的长弓。敲击兽的角被神圣化为减轻重量并通过将其浸泡在魔力伊特中软化，从而为敲击兽的角增添了令人惊讶的柔软感，进一步加强了附魔和奥术雕刻。用这把轻巧的弓进行攻击时如此的精准，就好像它自己会瞄准目标一样。然而，这或许只是持有者的自欺欺人。\n\n\n这种武器被施以魔法，并为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的好处：\n提升最大能量值: +20%\n提升能量回复速度: +10%\n技能强度: +20%\n技能冷却缩减: -10%\n增加经验值获取: -20%', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'A bow shaped from the horn of a Thrumbo. The horn is hallowed out to decrease the weight and softened by soaking it in a magicyte compound that adds a surprising suppleness to the horn. The bow is further enhanced with embedded enchantments and arcane engravings that travel the length of the bow. The bow is said to be almost sentient, able to determine the intended target through a mental link with the wielder. Arrows fired from this bow almost always hit their intended target. This effect does have a tendency to delude the users own capability, however.

This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +20%
Energy Regen: +10%
Damage Boost: +20%
Ability Cooldown: -10%
Class XP Gain: -20%',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: A bow shaped from the horn of a Thrumbo. The horn is hallowed out to decrease the weight and softened by soaking it in a magicyte compound that adds a surprising suppleness to the horn. The bow is further enhanced with embedded enchantments and arcane engravings that travel the length of the bow. The bow is said to be almost sentient, able to determine the intended target through a mental link with the wielder. Arrows fired from this bow almost always hit their intended target. This effect does have a tendency to delude the users own capability, however.

This weapon is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +20%
Energy Regen: +10%
Damage Boost: +20%
Ability Cooldown: -10%
Class XP Gain: -20%-->
  <ArcaneForge_ThrumBow.description>由敲击兽的角制作的长弓。敲击兽的角被神圣化为减轻重量并通过将其浸泡在魔力伊特中软化，从而为敲击兽的角增添了令人惊讶的柔软感，进一步加强了附魔和奥术雕刻。用这把轻巧的弓进行攻击时如此的精准，就好像它自己会瞄准目标一样。然而，这或许只是持有者的自欺欺人。\n\n\n这种武器被施以魔法，并为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的好处：\n提升最大能量值: +20%\n提升能量回复速度: +10%\n技能强度: +20%\n技能冷却缩减: -10%\n增加经验值获取: -20%</ArcaneForge_ThrumBow.description>
